    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "We are delighted to present this beautifully restored 4-bedroom detached bungalow, standing on its own private grounds within walking distance of Tinahely town centre.  Modernised to an immaculate walk-in standard, featuring a brand-new fully fitted kitchen, two refitted contemporary shower rooms, double glazing, oil heating and extensive yard space with outbuildings.  PURCHASE OPTIONS:-\r\nLot 1 – Bungalow, garage & Private Grounds – Guide Price €295,000\r\n Lot 2 – Adjoining Building Site with Full Planning Permission for c.129.5 sq m 3-bed \r\n                bungalow with council mains connections – P.O.A.                \r\nLot 3 – The Entirety (Bungalow, Garage & Adjoining Site) - P.O.A."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Kitchen/Dining Room\t– 3.66m x 2.29m (12’0” x 7’6”)\r\n \tMaster Bedroom (En-suite) – 3.35m x 3.35m (12’0”x 11’0”)\r\n \tBedroom 2\t– 3.66m x 2.44m (10’ x 6’6”)\r\n \tBedroom 3\t– 3.05m x 1.98m (10’ x 6’6”)\r\n \tBedroom 4 /Home Office\t– 3.35m x 3.05m (11’ x 10’)\r\n \tMain Bathroom\t– 2.29m x 2.13m (7’6” x 7’"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "EVERYDAY CONVENIENCE\r\n•\tSchools: Kilcommon NS (c140m): Tinahely NS (c.390m)\r\n•\tVillage Centre: 10-minute walk to Diamond Market Square, shops & cafes.\r\n•\tCulture & Fitness: Courthouse Arts Centre, local GAA and gym hereby.\r\n•\tTransport:  Direct bus links to Dublin (Route 132) with easy road access to Gorey/Arklow.\r\nRECREATION & COUNTRYSIDE\r\n•\tRailway Walk:  Scenic, family-friendly flat trail on your doorstep\r\n•\tTomnafinnoge Woods: Historic oak woodlands along River Derry\r\n•\tThe Wicklow Way: Famous hiking trails surrounding the valley\r\n•\tTinahely Farm Shop: Award-winning local café and artisan shop nearby"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: D1"
      }
